title: "checkExtensionManifestCompatibility(manifest, target) — pure author-time analyzer"
description: "Add the SDK author-time analyzer to src/sdk/compose.ts. Pure + synchronous: given an ExtensionManifest and a target {pmVersion, pmMaxVersionExceededMode?}, return {compatible, findings[], pmVersion} where each finding mirrors a loader bound outcome (pm_min_version_invalid/unchecked/unmet, pm_max_version_invalid/unchecked/exceeded/exceeded_warn) with severity error|warning. Delegates to the shared version-compat core so it agrees with the loader by construction. Re-export from the SDK barrel."
